 pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Our meat is vacuum-sealed and frozen for maximum freshness. Most products can be stored in the freezer for up to 12 months.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-hJZIGr iDoMvj pf-288_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-jlsrac RkmTy pf-289_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="d1e05484-5616-45a7-9120-4782708cdd94" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Do I need a subscription?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-iWBMXF pf-291_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-gdWTkz lkydnr pf-292_"><p class="sc-chKnEw cKwowb pf-293_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">No. You can order whenever you’d like. We also offer optional subscription programs for customers who want regular deliveries and savings.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-hJZIGr iDoMvj pf-295_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-jlsrac RkmTy pf-296_ pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="8c74f8d3-0801-416a-914d-2a952e7a376b" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Why does your meat taste different than groce